---
<section class="safety-section" id="safety">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">SAFETY & INTEGRITY</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">A Clean, Safe Mat Room in the East&nbsp;Bay</h2>
        <p class="section-lead" style="margin: 0 auto;">
          We believe high-level combat athletics require the strictest safety standards, cleanest facilities, and highest coach-to-athlete attention.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="safety-grid safety-grid--two">

        <div class="safety-card">
          <div class="safety-num">02</div>
          <h3 class="safety-title">3,800 Sq Ft Seamless Dollamur Mats</h3>
          <p class="safety-desc">
            2-inch cross-linked polyethylene shock absorption engineered to cushion high-velocity takedowns and protect developing youth joints and spines.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="safety-card">
          <div class="safety-num">04</div>
          <h3 class="safety-title">Dedicated Parent Lounge</h3>
          <p class="safety-desc">
            Full mat visibility with comfortable seating and Wi-Fi. Parents are always encouraged to watch practices, see their child's progress, and talk with coaches.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<style>
  .safety-section {
    padding: var(--space-section-tight);
    background-color: var(--color-canvas);
  }

  .safety-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .safety-card {
    background: var(--color-surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-default);
    padding: 28px 24px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
  }

  .safety-num {
    font-family: var(--font-accent);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-brand-text);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .safety-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .safety-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .safety-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .safety-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .safety-grid--two {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .safety-grid--two {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
